    "usage": "The whole-mesh part-choice overview exposes anonymous SAMPart3D regions in full-tool context as one multi-view sheet with colored part overlays for contact-region selection. Isolated cards are auxiliary debug views. After a part is selected, the renderer emits a selected-part bbox overview plus one selected-part face-highlight card per F marker; each face card shows the bbox, one highlighted bbox face, the contact point, and the surface normal/motion-axis arrow. This renderer must not emit legacy per-face/contact-choice paths."
